      "statement": "ArtTet uses a divide-and-conquer strategy to reconstruct articulated objects from multi-view observations.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "ArtMesh introduces part-aware restricted Delaunay remeshing to ensure mesh topology compatibility with articulation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "ArtMesh optimizes articulated object reconstruction using vertex-wise and pixel-wise motion consistency on transported mesh vertices and rendered images.",
